            "review_title": "Review at Banh Trang Phu Cuong",
            "review_text": "pascaloan11\nArcueil, France779 contributions\n1\nGood address\nSep 2024 • Couples\nGreat clean restaurant with nice decoration serving Vietnamese specialties.Lots of staff for friendly and efficient service.\nOn the plate: large lotus salad and pig ears; pigeon burped and for my companion Bo Lá lôt (beef rolled in a betel leaf) with salad cart and aromatic herbs very very fresh and clean.\nThe Award is the rider..\n185,000 Vietnamese dongs + VAT 8% or 7€ a little expensive for the city\nRead more\nTranslated from French\nShow original\nWritten September 24, 2024",
